<h3 id="array-simple"><code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">"array-simple"</code></h3>

<p>Use <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">T[]</code> or <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">readonly T[]</code> for simple types (i.e. types which are just primitive names or type references).
Use <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">Array&lt;T&gt;</code> or <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">ReadonlyArray&lt;T&gt;</code> for all other types (union types, intersection types, object types, function types, etc).</p>

